== Trivia ==
* The pickup quote appears to refer to the way the game associates Moon with secrets, with {{p|XVIII - The Moon}} teleporting to secret rooms and {{t|Fragmented Card}} being a torn Moon card that spawns extra secret rooms.
* "Bark at the moon!" could also be a reference to the song and album made by Ozzy Osbourne.

